---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { siteConfig } from "../../config";

const email = siteConfig.contactEmail;
---

<BaseLayout lang="en" canonicalPath="/en/terms/" title="Terms of service" description="Rules for using Moon Poro Bot on the League of Legends PL server.">
  <section class="doc">
    <h1>Terms of service</h1>
    <p class="updated">Updated: {siteConfig.lastUpdatedEn}</p>

    <div class="summary">
      <h2>In short</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Only verify your own Riot account.</li>
        <li>One Riot account, one Discord account.</li>
        <li>We do our best to keep the bot running, but we can't guarantee it.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <section>
      <h2>1. What Moon Poro is</h2>
      <p>Moon Poro is the bot of the League of Legends PL server, run by {siteConfig.operatorDisplayName}. It links Discord accounts with Riot accounts, assigns verification, region and rank roles, and helps the moderators. By using the bot, you accept these terms.</p>
      <p>Public verification still uses a League of Legends profile-icon challenge. Riot has approved Riot Sign On access, but the new sign-in flow is undergoing local testing and has not launched publicly.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>2. Who can use it</h2>
      <p>Anyone allowed to use Discord and a Riot account under their rules, including age requirements. Only link an account that belongs to you.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>3. What's not allowed</h2>
      <p>Don't verify other people's accounts, impersonate anyone, spam the bot, get around limits or exploit bugs. The rules of Discord, Riot Games and the server also apply.</p>
      <p>If the rules are broken, or the server's safety requires it, we may remove a link or block access to the bot.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>4. Rank and availability</h2>
      <p>The bot gets your rank directly from Riot Games and refreshes it periodically, so it can be briefly out of date. A Discord role is a label on our server, not an official Riot certificate.</p>
      <p>Riot Games and Discord services sometimes go down, and the bot may change or be shut down. It's provided as is, without warranties, to the extent the law allows.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>5. Removing your link</h2>
      <p>Use <code>/usun_weryfikacje</code> or the “Usuń powiązanie” (Remove link) button in “Moje konto”. The bot stops refreshing your rank and removes the Verified role. Region, rank and “Użytkownik” (Member) roles stay.</p>
      <p>When an administrator removes a link, the bot also removes region and rank roles. The “Użytkownik” role stays.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>6. Riot Games</h2>
      <p>Moon Poro isn't a Riot Games product and isn't endorsed by Riot. League of Legends and Riot Games are trademarks of Riot Games, Inc.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>7. Changes and contact</h2>
      <p>If we change these terms, we'll publish them here with a new date. Send questions to <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a>. Polish law applies, without affecting your rights as a consumer.</p>
    </section>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
